vel through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Formal Phone Conversations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you speak to an employer on the phone, you use polite, formal language."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: Hello, my name is Fred Warren. I'd like to speak to Peter Smith, please. </br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is Peter Smith."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Formal Language</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Informal Language</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hello, my name is \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hi, this is ...</br> Hi, it's \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'd like to speak to \u2026</br> Can I please speak to \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is \u2026 there?</br> I want to talk to \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"This is ... </br> I'm \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hello.</br> Hi.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals like <span class=\"strong\">would </span>and <span class=\"strong\">could</span> in formal conversations to make and respond to requests. The modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span> is less formal."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: Could you come for an interview?</br>  <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I would be happy to.</br> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "A response to a request can be positive or negative, but should always be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Request</span>: I would like to speak to someone in the design department please.</br>  <span class=\"strong\">Response</span>: Could you wait please?<br>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "part-time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "shorter hours of work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She works part-time at the bank -- twenty hours per week."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in a conversation about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">regarding </span>"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This letter is regarding your application."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "recent "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short time in the past"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Tell me about your recent jobs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "application "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a letter to try to get a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His job application looks very good. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "entry level"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the lowest job at a company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: She is starting in an entry level position to learn about the company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "intern "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who is training at a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This company has two interns learning how to do things."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "background "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " past experience at work or school"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He has a background in business studies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "research "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " information on a topic"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She has to do some research on marketing ads."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interview "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a formal meeting to get a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She is at an interview for a new position."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "variety "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "different types of things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Interns do a variety of jobs here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob01aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le06ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about a job online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out what courses you need to take to get the job. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out the job responsibilities. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look up new English words in the dictionary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 - 5 sentences about the job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences, and tell a partner more things about the job. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify a job online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I look up new words in the dictionary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements about a job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice reading my sentences."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le06ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le06ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: Hello, my name is Fred Warren. I'd like to speak to Peter Smith, please.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is Peter Smith.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: Hello, Peter.  I'm from MechaTech.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes?", "id": 1, "time": "10", "image": "engenn3le06ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Warren</span>: This call is regarding your recent application to our start-up software company.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh yes!